  (text "PA1=TAMP_OUT4 -> three lid contacts -> PC13=TAMP_IN1; hardware active shared output4.\nSeparate SW12 asynchronously resets MCU/LCD and disables SE while main power is present.\nPC1 is NOT tied to NRST: it is not a VBAT-capable input and a reset is not a lid event.\nBackup register anchor + active engine continuity must be checked; loss/flag => quarantine, never factory blank.\nNo automatic flag clear/reseed on normal boot. No proof against bridging, probing, SCA or all glitches.\nQualify backup life, reverse current, RF, reset latency, mechanics and injection before release."
    (at 195 268 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.05 1.05)
      )
    )
    (uuid "464acee8-8053-50c7-8425-b50210c4c43e")
  )
)
